    description: "Typed stable_id hashes include normalized signatures. Equivalent types across languages (String/str/string, int/Int/i32, bool/Boolean/boolean) must not collide in the hash. Requires a canonical type mapping table and normalization step before hashing. See ADR-0014 future work items 6-7."  # 3bae
