    justification: "Two of three typed stable_id blockers resolved (generics preserved, visibility extracted). Cross-language type normalization requires architectural decisions: which types to normalize, whether to use a shared mapping table, and whether typed stable_id is even needed yet. Recommend deferring until typed stable_id (WI-duzul) is actively being built."  # cc1d
